  "description": "Mike Rowe is an American television personality, actor, and advocate for vocational education. He is best known for hosting the TV show 'Dirty Jobs' and for his public commentary on the value of skilled trades and the flaws in the current education system. His quote in the meme is a direct reference to his public stance on the misallocation of educational resources and the devaluation of vocational training.",
